<h2>Who should consider Freshdesk?</h2><p>Freshdesk is worth evaluating for a team that needs email-first ticketing, a customer portal and a defined path to more routing and reporting. A very small team can also evaluate the six-month Free Program after the trial. Teams that need a wider channel mix should compare Freshdesk Omni and other multichannel products.</p>
